OL,3,GNEWSABid for 24-hour adult gaming
OL,4,Acentre refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bid to convert a town's former WH
OL,7,FSmith shop into an 24-hour adult gaming
OL,8,Fcentre has been refused over concerns
OL,9,Fit would exacerbate anti-social
OL,10,Fbehaviour.
OL,12,FGodden Gaming Organisation wanted to
OL,13,Fturn the vacant building in the centre
OL,14,Fof Bridgwater, Somerset, into a centre
OL,15,Fwith slot machines and create up to
OL,16,Fseven part-time and two full-time jobs.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
