OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSABid for 24-hour adult gaming
OL,4,Acentre refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn November 2025 Somerset Council's
OL,7,Flicensing team agreed the company could
OL,8,Fhave a licence for the gambling
OL,9,Ffacility but councillors on the
OL,10,Fplanning committee threw the
OL,11,Fapplication out on 11 August.
OL,13,FCouncillor Brian Smedley said: "It's
OL,14,Fnot an area that we need to be making
OL,15,Fworse by sending out the wrong
OL,16,Fsignals."
